__mtLangPack('zh','haw',{"A <b>kahuna pule</b>, a priest, will perform the ceremony of absolution. Then Kekoa may go home in peace. What should he do now?":"一位 <b>kahuna pule</b>（祭司）将主持赦免仪式。之后 Kekoa 就可以安心回家了。他现在该怎么做？","A band plays a guitar and an ʻukulele, and sings.":"一支乐队弹着吉他和 ʻukulele，边弹边唱。","A drone, for a view from above":"一架无人机，从空中俯瞰","A flash blinds the dancers, and talk covers the chant.":"闪光灯晃到了舞者的眼睛，说话声盖过了吟唱。","A fountain of fire, {A} / 3.":"一道火焰喷泉，{A} / 3。","A place of refuge, where a kapu-breaker could be absolved":"一个避难所，触犯 kapu 的人可以在那里获得赦免","A royal fish market":"一个王室鱼市","A surf school":"一所冲浪学校","A warm jacket: the rim is at {#1} m, cold before dawn":"一件保暖外套：火山口边缘海拔 {#1} m，黎明前很冷","An empty bag, to bring back a lava stone":"一个空袋子，用来带回一块熔岩石","Between two hālau, a friend wants to film the next one with the flash on, and talk through it. What do you say?":"两个 hālau 表演之间，一位朋友想开着闪光灯拍下一个表演，还边拍边说话。你会怎么说？","Both are modern":"两者都是现代风格","Drones are not allowed in the national park.":"国家公园内禁止使用无人机。","Fine, everyone films":"好吧，大家都拍","From a helicopter that lands on the rim":"从降落在火山口边缘的直升机上","Go on, just for a minute":"去吧，就一分钟","He reaches the shore of the puʻuhonua. Here, he is safe.":"他游到了 puʻuhonua 的岸边。在这里，他安全了。","Hide in the forest":"躲进森林","Hōnaunau, long ago. In old Hawaiʻi the <b>kapu</b>, sacred laws, ruled everything: a commoner could not let his shadow fall on the chief's grounds, nor walk in his footsteps. Breaking a kapu could mean death. A young fisherman, Kekoa, has let his shadow fall on the royal grounds. Where can he go?":"很久以前的 Hōnaunau。在古代 Hawaiʻi，<b>kapu</b>（神圣的律法）支配着一切：平民不能让自己的影子落在酋长的领地上，也不能踩着他的脚印走。触犯 kapu 可能意味着死亡。年轻的渔夫 Kekoa 让自己的影子落在了王室领地上。他能去哪里？","Kahiko":"Kahiko","Kahiko: the chant and the old instruments, skirts of ti leaves or kapa.":"Kahiko：吟唱与古老的乐器，用朱蕉（ti）叶或 kapa 做的裙子。","Lava stones stay where they are: they belong to the place, and to Pele.":"熔岩石要留在原地：它们属于这个地方，也属于 Pele。","Leave at once, before anyone sees him":"趁没人看见，马上离开","Listen to the instruments: gourd and drum with a chant are the old style; guitars and songs are the modern one.":"听听乐器：葫芦和鼓配上吟唱是古老风格；吉他和歌曲是现代风格。","Long strokes: rushing wastes your breath.":"长长地划水：着急只会白白耗费你的气力。","Never: the floor is molten rock and poisonous gas.":"绝对不行：火山口底部是熔融的岩石和有毒气体。","No flash, no talking: watch, and applaud at the end":"不开闪光灯，不说话：静静观看，结束时再鼓掌","No landing on the rim.":"火山口边缘不允许降落。","No: kahiko is the old style.":"不对：kahiko 才是古老风格。","On the floor of the crater":"在火山口底部","Sit on the Great Wall for a photo":"坐在大石墙上拍张照","Stay on the trail, and watch the honu of Keoneʻele cove from {#1} m":"走在步道上，在 {#1} m 外观看 Keoneʻele 小海湾的 honu","Surfing was a royal sport, but not here.":"冲浪曾是王室运动，但不在这里。","Swim across the bay to the puʻuhonua, the place of refuge":"游过海湾，到达 puʻuhonua 避难所","The crater is resting. Wait for the next fountain.":"火山口正在休息。等待下一次喷泉。","The fishponds were nearby, but no.":"鱼塘就在附近，但不对。","The kiʻi are not to be touched: they guard the place.":"kiʻi 不能触摸：它们守护着这个地方。","The walls are fragile and sacred: never climb or sit on them.":"石墙脆弱而神圣：绝不要攀爬或坐在上面。","Torches on the shore behind him. <b>Swim</b>: tap in a steady rhythm, long strokes, to reach the other side.":"他身后的岸上亮起了火把。<b>游泳</b>：有节奏地点击，长长地划水，游到对岸。","Touch a kiʻi for luck":"摸一摸 kiʻi 求好运","Wait for the ceremony of the kahuna pule, then go home":"等待 kahuna pule 的仪式，然后回家","Wait: it is still rising.":"等等：它还在上升。","What was a puʻuhonua?":"puʻuhonua 是什么？","Where do visitors watch the eruption of Kīlauea?":"游客在哪里观看 Kīlauea 的喷发？","Which style of hula is the ancient one?":"哪种 hula 风格是古老的？","Without the ceremony he would still be a kapu-breaker outside the walls.":"没有仪式，他仍然是一个被挡在墙外的 kapu 触犯者。","Yes. A hula tells a story that the hālau has worked on for months: it is received in silence.":"对。一段 hula 讲述的是 hālau 排练了好几个月的故事：要在安静中欣赏。","Yes. Absolved, he could return to his family without fear.":"对。获得赦免后，他就可以毫无畏惧地回到家人身边。","Yes. Keoneʻele was the royal canoe landing; the turtles rest there today.":"对。Keoneʻele 曾是王室独木舟登岸处；如今海龟在那里休息。","Yes. The view from the overlook is the one the park keeps safe for everyone.":"对。观景台的视野正是公园为每个人保障安全的那一处。","Yes: chant, ipu heke and pahu. ʻAuana, the modern style, came with Western instruments.":"对：吟唱、ipu heke 和 pahu。ʻAuana（现代风格）随西方乐器而来。","Yes: defeated warriors and those who could not fight found safety there too.":"对：战败的武士和无法作战的人也能在那里得到庇护。","Yes: inside the puʻuhonua, no blood could be shed.":"对：在 puʻuhonua 里，不得流血。","You swam across Hōnaunau Bay with Kekoa to the puʻuhonua, waited for the kahuna pule, and visited the place today the right way: on the trail, far from the walls and the kiʻi, the honu watched from a distance.":"你和 Kekoa 一起游过了 Hōnaunau 湾，到达 puʻuhonua，等待 kahuna pule，又以正确的方式参观了今天的这个地方：走在步道上，远离石墙和 kiʻi，远远地观看 honu。","You watched the Merrie Monarch Festival in Hilo from the stands and told kahiko from ʻauana by the instruments and the costumes ({A} hālau of 4 at the first try), in silence during the hula.":"你在 Hilo 的看台上观看了 Merrie Monarch 节，凭乐器和服装分辨出了 kahiko 和 ʻauana（第一次尝试就认对了 4 个 hālau 中的 {A} 个），并在 hula 表演时保持安静。","ʻAuana":"ʻAuana","ʻAuana is the modern style, with guitars and songs.":"ʻAuana 是现代风格，有吉他和歌曲。","ʻAuana: Western instruments, songs, flowing dresses.":"ʻAuana：西方乐器、歌曲、飘逸的长裙。","Hālau {#1} of 4.":"第 {#1} 个 hālau，共 4 个。","Which style is it?":"这是哪种风格？","A chanter beats an <b>ipu heke</b>, a double gourd, and chants.":"一位吟唱者敲着 <b>ipu heke</b>（双葫芦），边敲边吟唱。","A drummer beats a <b>pahu</b>, a drum covered with sharkskin, and chants.":"一位鼓手敲着 <b>pahu</b>（蒙着鲨鱼皮的鼓），边敲边吟唱。","A band plays a <b>steel guitar</b>, a Hawaiian invention of the {#1}s, and a guitar, and sings.":"一支乐队弹着<b>钢棒吉他</b>（{#1}年代的夏威夷发明）和一把吉他，边弹边唱。","Eye protection, against the ash and the tephra":"护目镜，防火山灰和火山碎屑","A headlamp: the path is dark before dawn":"头灯：黎明前的小路一片漆黑","Kīlauea has been erupting at its summit since December {#1}, in <b>episodes</b>: for a few hours, lava fountains rise from vents in the crater of <b>Halemaʻumaʻu</b>, often more than {#2} m high, then it rests. The park says the best time to watch is before sunrise. <b>Pack your bag</b>: choose the three right things.":"自 {#1} 年 12 月起，Kīlauea 的山顶一直在喷发，分为一个个<b>喷发阶段</b>：几个小时里，熔岩喷泉从 <b>Halemaʻumaʻu</b> 火山口的喷口涌出，往往高逾 {#2} m，然后归于平静。公园说，最佳观赏时间是日出之前。<b>收拾你的背包</b>：选出三样合适的东西。","Ready: eye protection against the ash, a headlamp for the dark path, warm clothes for the cold rim.":"准备好了：护目镜挡火山灰，头灯照亮黑暗的小路，保暖衣物抵御火山口边缘的寒冷。","At <b>Uēkahuna</b>, the viewing deck on the bluff, behind the stone wall and the cable, the crater glows. An episode begins. <b>Take a photo when the fountain is at its highest</b>: three good photos.":"在 <b>Uēkahuna</b>——悬崖上的观景台，站在石墙和缆绳后面，火山口泛着红光。一个喷发阶段开始了。<b>在喷泉最高时拍照</b>：拍三张好照片。","A visitor wants to climb over the cable, to get closer for a better photo. What do you say?":"一位游客想翻过缆绳，靠近一点拍张更好的照片。你会怎么说？","Stay behind the wall and the cable: the cliff drops about {#1} m to the crater floor, and its edges crumble":"请待在石墙和缆绳后面：悬崖垂直落下约 {#1} m 直到火山口底部，而且边缘会崩塌","The rim can give way, and the gases are dangerous: never past the barrier.":"火山口边缘可能坍塌，气体也很危险：绝不要越过护栏。","From Uēkahuna and the other overlooks on the rim":"从 Uēkahuna 和火山口边缘的其他观景点","Yes: from the rim, behind the barriers, best before sunrise.":"对：在火山口边缘，护栏后面，最好在日出前。","You watched an episode of Kīlauea from the rim of Halemaʻumaʻu before dawn, with eye protection and a headlamp, behind the stone wall and the cable, and left the lava stones where they belong.":"你在黎明前从 Halemaʻumaʻu 火山口边缘观看了 Kīlauea 的一个喷发阶段，戴着护目镜和头灯，站在石墙和缆绳后面，还把熔岩石留在了原处。","Today the puʻuhonua is a national historical park. The <b>Great Wall</b>, more than {#1} years old, runs more than {#2} m, up to {#3} m high, its lava stones fitted without mortar; <b>Hale o Keawe</b>, first built about {#4}, held the bones of {#5} aliʻi, guarded by <b>kiʻi</b>. The kapu system ended in {#6}. On your visit, which is right?":"如今 puʻuhonua 是一座国家历史公园。<b>大石墙</b>已有 {#1} 多年历史，长逾 {#2} m，高达 {#3} m，熔岩石块不用灰浆砌合；<b>Hale o Keawe</b> 约于 {#4} 年初建，曾安放 {#5} 位 aliʻi 的遗骨，由 <b>kiʻi</b> 守护。kapu 制度于 {#6} 年终结。参观时，哪种做法是对的？","Hilo, the week after Easter: the <b>Merrie Monarch Festival</b>, named for King David Kalākaua, “the Merrie Monarch”, who brought hula back to his court. The festival began in {#1}, the hula competition in {#2}: Thursday Miss Aloha Hula, then the hālau, the hula schools, Friday night in <b>kahiko</b>, the ancient style, and Saturday night in <b>ʻauana</b>, the modern style. You are in the stands. A hālau comes on stage.":"复活节后的那一周，Hilo：<b>Merrie Monarch 节</b>，以“快乐君主”David Kalākaua 国王命名，是他让 hula 重回宫廷。节日始于 {#1} 年，hula 比赛始于 {#2} 年：周四是 Miss Aloha Hula，接着是各个 hālau（hula 学校），周五晚跳 <b>kahiko</b>（古典风格），周六晚跳 <b>ʻauana</b>（现代风格）。你坐在看台上。一个 hālau 登台了。",", a head lei of palapalai fern":"，用 palapalai 蕨做的头部 lei","lei ʻāʻī":"lei ʻāʻī",", a neck lei":"，颈部 lei",", for the wrists and the ankles":"，戴在手腕和脚踝上","A shiny cellophane skirt":"闪亮的玻璃纸裙","No cellophane: in kahiko the lei come from plants that belong to the hula gods.":"不能用玻璃纸：在 kahiko 中，lei 取自属于 hula 诸神的植物。","A plain black pāʻū":"一条纯黑色的 pāʻū","The judges do not want plain black: the pāʻū carries colour and pattern.":"评委不要纯黑色：pāʻū 要有颜色和图案。","Backstage, a dancer of the next hālau gets ready for <b>kahiko</b>. The judges look at every detail. <b>Dress her</b>: choose the three things they expect.":"后台，下一个 hālau 的一位舞者正在为 <b>kahiko</b> 做准备。评委会看每一个细节。<b>为她装扮</b>：选出评委期待的三样东西。","Ready: lei poʻo, lei ʻāʻī and four kūpeʻe, all of plants, as the judges expect for kahiko.":"准备好了：lei poʻo、lei ʻāʻī 和四个 kūpeʻe，全都用植物做成，正是评委对 kahiko 的期待。","Strip {A} of 4.":"第 {A} 条，共 4 条。","Four long strips of white inner bark.":"四长条白色内层树皮。","Kona, with a kapa maker. <b>Wauke</b>, the paper mulberry, is cut before it is two years old, when its stems stand {#1} to {#2} m tall. <b>Peel the bark</b> off each stem in one long strip: tap the stems from the top.":"Kona，和一位 kapa 匠人在一起。<b>Wauke</b>（构树）要在不满两岁时砍下，那时它的茎高 {#1} 到 {#2} m。把每根茎的<b>树皮剥下来</b>，剥成完整的一长条：从顶端点击茎。","The inner bark is rolled, wrapped in <b>tī leaves</b> and left to soak, so that it softens. For how long?":"内层树皮卷起来，用 <b>tī 叶</b>包好浸泡，让它变软。要泡多久？","Two hours":"两个小时","Too short: the fibres are still stiff.":"太短了：纤维还很硬。","About two weeks":"大约两周","Yes: about two weeks in the water, wrapped in tī leaves.":"对：用 tī 叶包好，在水里泡大约两周。","A whole year":"整整一年","Far too long: it would rot.":"太久了：它会腐烂。","First the round <b>hohoa</b>, on a stone anvil: the strip spreads and grows wide. <b>Beat</b> in a steady rhythm, not too fast.":"先用圆形的 <b>hohoa</b>，在石砧上捶打：树皮条会摊开、变宽。<b>捶打</b>要保持稳定的节奏，不要太快。","Steady: a hurried blow tears the bark.":"稳住：捶得太急，树皮就会撕裂。","Now the four-sided <b>iʻe kuku</b>, on a wooden anvil. Its carved grooves press a <b>watermark</b> into the cloth. Keep beating.":"接着用四面的 <b>iʻe kuku</b>，在木砧上捶打。它刻出的凹槽会在布上压出<b>水印纹</b>。继续捶打。","The kapa is thin, wide and soft, with the lines of the iʻe kuku in it.":"kapa 又薄又宽又柔软，上面带着 iʻe kuku 的纹路。","Dyed and dry, the kapa is printed with an <b>ʻohe kāpala</b>, a thin bamboo stamp carved at one end. Choose a pattern, then <b>stamp the four rows</b>.":"染色晾干后，用 <b>ʻohe kāpala</b> 给 kapa 印花，这是一端刻有花纹的细竹印模。选一种图案，然后<b>印满四行</b>。","Triangles":"三角形","Chevrons":"人字纹","Blocks":"方块","Row by row, from the top, so the pattern lines up.":"一行一行，从上往下，让图案对齐。","A kapa printed with your own pattern.":"一块印着你自己图案的 kapa。","What is kapa made from?":"kapa 是用什么做的？","The inner bark of the wauke, beaten thin":"wauke 的内层树皮，捶打变薄","Yes: the same cloth as the tapa of Tahiti, made from ʻaute.":"对：和 Tahiti 用 ʻaute 做的 tapa 是同一种布。","Coconut fibre, woven":"椰子纤维，编织而成","Coconut fibre makes cord, not kapa.":"椰子纤维用来做绳子，不是 kapa。","Pandanus leaves, plaited":"露兜树叶，编结而成","Lauhala makes mats and hats.":"Lauhala 用来编席子和帽子。","You peeled the wauke, soaked it in tī leaves, beat it with the hohoa and the iʻe kuku until its watermark showed, and printed your kapa with an ʻohe kāpala.":"你剥下了 wauke 的树皮，用 tī 叶包好浸泡，用 hohoa 和 iʻe kuku 捶打直到显出水印纹，还用 ʻohe kāpala 给你的 kapa 印了花。","On the shore of Kāneʻohe Bay, under the cliffs of the Koʻolau, the <b>loko iʻa</b> of <b>Heʻeia</b>: {#1} to {#2} years old, its wall, the <b>kuapā</b>, closes a circle of about {#3} km around {#4} hectares of water. The sea enters through the <b>mākāhā</b>, the gates. Watch the tide: <b>open the mākāhā while the tide is rising</b>, so the young fish come in with the sea.":"在 Kāneʻohe 湾岸边、Koʻolau 山崖之下，是 <b>Heʻeia</b> 的 <b>loko iʻa</b>：它已有 {#1} 到 {#2} 年历史，它的石墙 <b>kuapā</b> 围成一个约 {#3} km 的圆圈，圈住 {#4} 公顷水面。海水从 <b>mākāhā</b>（水闸）流进来。留意潮水：<b>在涨潮时打开 mākāhā</b>，让小鱼随海水游进来。","Open the mākāhā":"打开 mākāhā","The sea pours in, and little fish with it: they will feed on the limu inside and grow.":"海水涌进来，小鱼也跟着进来了：它们会在里面吃 limu，慢慢长大。","The tide is going out: wait until the arrow turns green and the water rises.":"正在退潮：等箭头变绿、水位上涨。","Inside, the fish feed on the <b>limu</b> and grow. The mākāhā has two grills: little fish slip through, but an <b>ʻamaʻama</b> grown fat cannot get back to the sea. <b>Close the gate</b> when a big fish is in the mākāhā: catch three.":"在里面，鱼吃 <b>limu</b> 长大。mākāhā 有两道栅栏：小鱼可以钻过去，但长胖的 <b>ʻamaʻama</b> 就回不了大海了。当一条大鱼游进 mākāhā 时，<b>关上闸门</b>：抓三条。","Close the gate":"关上闸门","An ʻamaʻama, {A} / 3. It took about three years to grow this big.":"一条 ʻamaʻama，{A} / 3。它花了大约三年才长这么大。","Too small: open again and let it grow. The little ones are the pond’s future.":"太小了：重新打开，让它继续长。小鱼是鱼塘的未来。","Wait until a fish swims into the mākāhā.":"等一条鱼游进 mākāhā。","Hand the bucket to the next person, the one with the white ring.":"把桶递给下一个人，就是戴白圈的那位。","Bucket {A} of 3 poured into the gap.":"第 {A} 桶（共 3 桶）倒进了缺口。","Workday with <b>Paepae o Heʻeia</b>, the group that cares for the pond: a flood in {#1} broke part of the wall, and volunteers rebuilt it by hand with the old stones. <b>Pass the bucket</b> of coral and stones along the line to fill the gap: tap the next person.":"和 <b>Paepae o Heʻeia</b> 一起的劳动日，这个团体负责照料鱼塘：{#1} 年的一场洪水冲垮了部分石墙，志愿者用原来的石头亲手把它重建起来。沿着队伍<b>传递水桶</b>，用珊瑚和石块填补缺口：点击下一个人。","Red mangrove, brought to Oʻahu about {#1}, pushes its roots into the wall and breaks it. <b>Pull out the seedlings</b> growing on the kuapā.":"红树大约在 {#1} 年被带到 Oʻahu，它的根钻进石墙，把墙撑裂。<b>拔掉 kuapā 上长出的幼苗</b>。","The wall is clear. Mahalo, say the kiaʻi of the pond.":"石墙清理干净了。鱼塘的 kiaʻi 说：Mahalo。","Why can’t a fat ʻamaʻama leave the fishpond?":"为什么长胖的 ʻamaʻama 离不开鱼塘？","The water is too warm outside":"外面的水太热了","No: it is the gate that keeps it.":"不对：是闸门把它留住的。","It has grown too big to slip back through the grills of the mākāhā":"它长得太大，钻不回 mākāhā 的栅栏了","Yes: it came in small, ate the limu, and stayed. The pond feeds its fish by itself.":"对：它小时候游进来，吃了 limu，就留下来了。鱼塘自己就能养活它的鱼。","It is fed every day":"每天都有人喂它","No: the fish graze the limu that grows in the brackish water.":"不对：鱼吃的是半咸水里长出的 limu。","You opened the mākāhā of Heʻeia on the rising tide, caught three fat ʻamaʻama and let the little fish grow, passed the bucket to rebuild the kuapā and pulled the mangrove from the wall.":"你在涨潮时打开了 Heʻeia 的 mākāhā，抓到三条肥美的 ʻamaʻama，让小鱼继续生长，还传递水桶重建了 kuapā，并拔除了石墙上的红树。","Sand Island, Honolulu Harbor, at night: <b>Hōkūleʻa</b> rests at her home port. In 1976 she sailed to Tahiti in 34 days with no instruments; this year her crew celebrates 50 years. Her navigators learn the <b>star compass</b>: the horizon in 32 houses, where the stars rise and set. First the four points: tap <b>{A}</b>, where the stars arrive.":"夜晚，Honolulu 港的 Sand Island：<b>Hōkūleʻa</b> 停泊在她的母港。1976 年，她不用任何仪器，花 34 天航行到了 Tahiti；今年，她的船员庆祝她 50 周年。她的领航员学习<b>星罗盘</b>：地平线分成 32 个星宫，标出星星升起和落下的地方。先认四个方位：点击 <b>{A}</b>，星星到来的地方。","west, where they enter the sea":"西方，星星没入大海的地方","Hikina is where the sun and the stars come up":"Hikina 是太阳和星星升起的地方","ʻĀkau is toward Hōkūpaʻa, the North Star":"ʻĀkau 朝向 Hōkūpaʻa，即北极星","Komohana is where they go down into the sea":"Komohana 是它们落入大海的地方","Hema is toward the Southern Cross":"Hema 朝向南十字座","ʻĀina Kona":"ʻĀina Kona","ʻĀina Malanai":"ʻĀina Malanai","Nālani Hoʻolua":"Nālani Hoʻolua","Nālani Koʻolau":"Nālani Koʻolau","Each quarter has seven houses, from the horizon up: Lā, ʻĀina, Noio, Manu, Nālani, Nāleo, Haka. A star <b>rises in {A}</b>{B}. <b>Where will it set?</b> Tap the house.":"每个象限有七个星宫，从地平线往上依次是：Lā、ʻĀina、Noio、Manu、Nālani、Nāleo、Haka。一颗星<b>从 {A} 升起</b>{B}。<b>它会在哪里落下？</b>点击那个星宫。","Yes: it sets in":"对：它落在",", the house of the same name on the other side.":"，也就是另一侧同名的星宫。","A star sets in the house with the same name as the one it rose in, on the opposite side of the sky.":"星星落下的星宫与它升起的星宫同名，位于天空的另一侧。","In {#1} the navigator of Hōkūleʻa was <b>Mau Piailug</b>, a master from Satawal in Micronesia. He found Tahiti, {#2} km away. What did he use?":"{#1} 年，Hōkūleʻa 的领航员是 <b>Mau Piailug</b>，一位来自密克罗尼西亚 Satawal 岛的大师。他找到了 {#2} km 外的 Tahiti。他靠的是什么？","A magnetic compass and a chart":"磁罗盘和海图","No: none on board.":"不对：船上都没有。","The stars, the swells, the wind and the birds":"星星、涌浪、风和鸟","Yes: the house of each star, the shape of the swells, and at the end the birds that fish from land.":"对：每颗星的星宫、涌浪的形状，最后还有从陆地出海捕鱼的鸟。","A radio beacon":"无线电信标","No: no instruments at all.":"不对：没有任何仪器。","How many houses does the Hawaiian star compass have?":"夏威夷星罗盘有多少个星宫？","Eight would be only the main points and the quarters.":"八个只是主方位加上象限。","Yes: {#1} houses of {#2}° each, seven in each quarter plus the four points.":"对：{#1} 个星宫，每个 {#2}°，每个象限七个，再加上四个方位点。","That is the days of the year.":"那是一年的天数。","At the home port of Hōkūleʻa you found Hikina, Komohana, ʻĀkau and Hema on the star compass, followed two stars from the house where they rise to the house where they set, and learned how Mau Piailug found Tahiti.":"在 Hōkūleʻa 的母港，你在星罗盘上找到了 Hikina、Komohana、ʻĀkau 和 Hema，追随两颗星从升起的星宫到落下的星宫，还了解了 Mau Piailug 是如何找到 Tahiti 的。","East of Honolulu, <b>Hanauma Bay</b> fills an old volcanic crater, about {#1} years old, whose seaward wall the ocean broke open. Its reef is a nature preserve. <b>Which day can you visit?</b>":"Honolulu 以东，<b>Hanauma 湾</b>填满了一个约 {#1} 年历史的古老火山口，它朝海的一面已被海洋冲破。这里的珊瑚礁是自然保护区。<b>你哪天可以参观？</b>","Closed on Mondays and Tuesdays: two days a week the fish feed in peace.":"周一和周二关闭：每周有两天，鱼儿可以安心觅食。","Open. Visitors book two days ahead, at {#1}:{#2} in the morning, Hawaiʻi time.":"开放。游客需提前两天预约，时间是 Hawaiʻi 时间早上 {#1}:{#2}。","Everyone first watches a short <b>film</b> at the Marine Education Center: how to protect the reef. Then, which sunscreen do you put on?":"每个人都要先在海洋教育中心看一部简短的<b>影片</b>：如何保护珊瑚礁。然后，你会涂哪种防晒霜？","A mineral sunscreen, zinc oxide":"矿物防晒霜，氧化锌","Yes: since {#1} Hawaiʻi bans sunscreens with oxybenzone and octinoxate, which harm the coral.":"对：自 {#1} 年起，Hawaiʻi 禁止含有氧苯酮和甲氧基肉桂酸辛酯的防晒霜，它们会伤害珊瑚。","Any sunscreen with oxybenzone":"任何含氧苯酮的防晒霜","Banned in Hawaiʻi since {#1}: it harms the coral.":"自 {#1} 年起在 Hawaiʻi 被禁：它会伤害珊瑚。","None, and stay four hours in the sun":"什么都不涂，在太阳下待四个小时","A rash guard and a mineral sunscreen protect you and the reef.":"防晒衣加矿物防晒霜，既保护你，也保护珊瑚礁。","Humuhumunukunukuāpuaʻa":"Humuhumunukunukuāpuaʻa",", the reef triggerfish: the fish of the State of Hawaiʻi.":"，礁石鳞鲀：Hawaiʻi 州的州鱼。","Lauʻīpala":"Lauʻīpala",", the yellow tang, grazing the algae on the coral.":"，黄高鳍刺尾鱼，正在啃食珊瑚上的藻类。",", a parrotfish: it bites the dead coral and turns it into white sand.":"，一种鹦嘴鱼：它啃咬死去的珊瑚，把它变成白沙。",", a green turtle: watch it from {#1} m, never touch it.":"，一只绿海龟：在 {#1} m 外观察，绝不要触摸它。","In the water, float flat above the reef. <b>Tap the four animals</b> to name them, and never touch the coral.":"在水里，平趴着漂浮在珊瑚礁上方。<b>点击这四种动物</b>说出它们的名字，绝不要碰珊瑚。","Never stand on or touch the coral: it is alive, and it breaks.":"绝不要站在珊瑚上或触摸珊瑚：它是活的，而且会断。","Back on the beach, a child wants to throw bread to the fish. What do you say?":"回到海滩上，一个孩子想朝鱼扔面包。你会怎么说？","Go on, they love it":"扔吧，它们最爱吃了","Feeding the fish is forbidden here: it changes what they eat and how they behave":"这里禁止喂鱼：这会改变它们吃的东西和它们的行为","Yes: in the preserve nothing is fed, taken, or moved, not even a stone.":"对：在保护区里，什么都不能喂、不能拿、不能挪动，连一块石头也不行。","Feeding is forbidden in the preserve.":"保护区内禁止喂食。","Why is Hanauma Bay closed two days a week?":"为什么 Hanauma 湾每周关闭两天？","To clean the beach":"为了清理海滩","Not the reason.":"不是这个原因。","So the fish can feed undisturbed":"让鱼能不受打扰地觅食","Yes: two days each week the bay belongs to its fish.":"对：每周有两天，这片海湾属于它的鱼儿。","Because of the waves":"因为海浪","No: it is closed for the reef’s sake.":"不对：关闭是为了珊瑚礁。","You visited Hanauma Bay on an open day, watched the film, wore a mineral sunscreen, named the humuhumunukunukuāpuaʻa, the lauʻīpala, the uhu and the honu without touching the coral, and fed no one.":"你在开放日参观了 Hanauma 湾，看了影片，涂了矿物防晒霜，在不碰珊瑚的情况下认出了 humuhumunukunukuāpuaʻa、lauʻīpala、uhu 和 honu，而且谁也没喂。","A sunrise reservation, between {#1} and {#2} am":"日出预约，凌晨 {#1} 点到 {#2} 点之间","A warm jacket, a hat and gloves: it can freeze up there":"保暖外套、帽子和手套：山上可能结冰","A blanket for the wait":"等待时用的毯子","Shorts and sandals: it is Hawaiʻi!":"短裤和凉鞋：这可是 Hawaiʻi！","At {#1} m before dawn it is often below freezing.":"黎明前在 {#1} m 的高处，气温常常低于冰点。","A drone, to film the sunrise":"一架无人机，用来拍日出","Maui, before dawn: the road climbs to the summit of <b>Haleakalā</b>, more than {#1} m above the sea. Cars enter between {#2} and {#3} am only with a reservation. <b>Pack</b>: choose the three right things.":"Maui，黎明前：公路爬升到 <b>Haleakalā</b> 山顶，海拔超过 {#1} m。凌晨 {#2} 点到 {#3} 点之间，车辆只有预约才能进入。<b>收拾行装</b>：选出三样合适的东西。","Ready for the cold summit.":"准备好迎接寒冷的山顶了。","Snared! {A} / {B}":"套住了！{A} / {B}","Wait until that leg of the sun shines, then throw your cord.":"等太阳的那条腿发光时，再抛出你的绳子。","The legend, as the park tells it: long ago the sun crossed the sky so fast that <b>Hina’s kapa</b> could never dry. Hina gave her son <b>Māui</b> fifteen cords; his grandmother, by her <b>wiliwili</b> tree on the mountain, gave him one more. Now the sun rises: <b>snare each leg of the sun when it shines</b>.":"公园讲述的传说：很久以前，太阳在天上走得太快，<b>Hina 的 kapa</b> 总也晒不干。Hina 给了儿子 <b>Māui</b> 十五根绳子；他的祖母在山上她的 <b>wiliwili</b> 树旁，又给了他一根。太阳升起来了：<b>太阳的每条腿一发光，就把它套住</b>。","Tied to the wiliwili, the sun begged to be let go. Māui made it <b>promise to cross the sky slowly</b>, and since then the days are long enough for kapa to dry. The mountain kept its name: <b>Haleakalā</b>, the house of the sun.":"被拴在 wiliwili 树上的太阳恳求放了它。Māui 让它<b>答应慢慢走过天空</b>，从那以后，白天就长得足够让 kapa 晒干了。这座山保留了它的名字：<b>Haleakalā</b>，太阳之屋。","Let the sun go":"放太阳走","In the light, the <b>ʻāhinahina</b>, the silversword, shines on the cinders. It lives up to {#1} years, flowers only once, a stalk of up to {#2} m with hundreds of red-purple flowers, and then dies. A visitor steps off the trail to touch one. What do you say?":"晨光中，<b>ʻāhinahina</b>（银剑草）在火山渣上闪闪发光。它能活到 {#1} 年，一生只开一次花，花茎高达 {#2} m，开出数百朵紫红色的花，然后死去。一位游客走下步道想去摸一株。你会怎么说？","Just a quick photo, it’s fine":"就拍张照，没关系的","Stay on the trail: footsteps crush its shallow roots, and visitors once nearly wiped it out":"请待在步道上：脚步会踩坏它很浅的根，游客曾经差点让它灭绝","Yes. It grows only here, on the slopes of Haleakalā.":"对。它只生长在这里，Haleakalā 的山坡上。","Its roots lie just under the cinders: one step can kill it.":"它的根就在火山渣下面：一脚就可能踩死它。","What does Haleakalā mean?":"Haleakalā 是什么意思？","House of the sun":"太阳之屋","Yes: hale, house; ka lā, the sun.":"对：hale 是房子；ka lā 是太阳。","Mountain of snow":"雪山","That would be Mauna Kea, the white mountain, on Hawaiʻi Island.":"那是 Mauna Kea，白色的山，在 Hawaiʻi 岛上。","Red hill":"红山","Puʻuʻulaʻula, the Red Hill, is only its highest point.":"Puʻuʻulaʻula（红山）只是它的最高点。","You watched the sunrise from the summit of Haleakalā, wrapped up against the cold, snared the sun with Māui so that Hina’s kapa could dry, and admired the ʻāhinahina from the trail.":"你裹得暖暖的，在 Haleakalā 山顶看了日出，和 Māui 一起套住太阳让 Hina 的 kapa 能晒干，还在步道上欣赏了 ʻāhinahina。","Every winter, thousands of humpback whales, <b>koholā</b>, swim from Alaska to the warm, shallow waters between Maui, Lānaʻi and Molokaʻi, a marine sanctuary, to give birth and mate. <b>Which month will you see them?</b>":"每年冬天，成千上万头座头鲸（<b>koholā</b>）从阿拉斯加游到 Maui、Lānaʻi 和 Molokaʻi 之间温暖的浅海，那里是一处海洋保护区，它们在那里生产和交配。<b>你会在哪个月看到它们？</b>","The best: most whales are here from January to March.":"最佳时机：一月到三月，这里的鲸最多。","Yes: the season runs from November to May, most of all January to March.":"对：观鲸季从十一月到五月，尤其是一月到三月。","In summer they are feeding in Alaska. Come between November and May.":"夏天它们在阿拉斯加觅食。请在十一月到五月之间来。","A blow ahead! The law forbids coming closer than <b>{#1} yards</b>, about {#2} m, to a humpback. The boat drifts towards the whales: <b>put the engine in neutral</b> before {#3} yards.":"前方有喷气！法律禁止靠近座头鲸 <b>{#1} 码</b>以内，约 {#2} m。船正朝鲸漂过去：在 {#3} 码之前<b>把引擎挂到空挡</b>。","Neutral":"空挡","Too close! Start again from farther out.":"太近了！从更远的地方重新开始。","Still far: let the boat drift a little closer, slowly.":"还很远：让船慢慢再漂近一点。","Neutral at {A} yards. The whale may come to you; you never go to it.":"在 {A} 码处挂空挡。鲸可以游向你；你绝不主动靠近它。","It breathes out at the surface: a tall cloud of spray, seen from far away.":"它在水面呼气：一团高高的水雾，很远就能看见。","A breach":"跃身击浪","It leaps out of the water and falls back with a crash.":"它跃出水面，再轰然落下。","A fluke":"举尾","It lifts its tail before a deep dive. The black and white under the tail is different for every whale, like a fingerprint.":"它在深潜前抬起尾巴。尾巴下面的黑白花纹每头鲸都不一样，就像指纹。","Watch the whale. <b>What is it doing?</b>":"看着这头鲸。<b>它在做什么？</b>","Look again at the shape above the water.":"再看看水面上的形状。","How close may a boat come to a humpback whale in Hawaiʻi?":"在 Hawaiʻi，船最多可以靠近座头鲸多近？","Far too close: that is the distance for a resting turtle.":"太近了：那是对休息中的海龟的距离。","Yes: and if a whale comes closer by itself, stay in neutral.":"对：如果鲸自己游近，就保持空挡。","As close as you like if you are quiet":"只要安静，想多近都行","No: the {#1}-yard rule is the law, for boats, kayaks, swimmers and drones.":"不对：{#1} 码规定是法律，适用于船只、皮划艇、游泳者和无人机。","In whale season you watched the koholā from beyond {#1} yards, the engine in neutral, and told a blow, a breach and a fluke apart.":"在观鲸季，你在 {#1} 码以外、引擎挂空挡观看了 koholā，还分辨出了喷气、跃身击浪和举尾。","The water runs downhill: open the highest loʻi first, then the next one below.":"水往低处流：先打开最高的 loʻi，再打开下面的那一块。","Cool, flowing water in every terrace, and back to the stream below.":"每层梯田都流着清凉的活水，然后流回下面的溪里。","Plant in a line, one after the other.":"排成一行，一个接一个地种。","Six huli planted in the mud.":"六株 huli 种进了泥里。","Not ready yet: leave it to grow.":"还没熟：让它继续长。","A corm of kalo, {A} / 3.":"一个 kalo 球茎，{A} / 3。","On the road to Hāna, the lava peninsula of <b>Keʻanae</b> is green with <b>loʻi</b>, flooded terraces of <b>kalo</b>, taro. A channel, an ʻauwai, brings the water of the stream. <b>Open the gates</b> so the water flows from terrace to terrace.":"在通往 Hāna 的路上，<b>Keʻanae</b> 熔岩半岛上满是绿油油的 <b>loʻi</b>——种着 <b>kalo</b>（芋头）的灌水梯田。一条水渠 ʻauwai 引来溪水。<b>打开闸门</b>，让水从一层梯田流到下一层。","The <b>huli</b> is the top of a kalo kept after the harvest: the base of the stalks with a slice of the corm. <b>Plant the huli</b> in the soft mud, one after the other.":"<b>huli</b> 是收获后留下的 kalo 顶部：茎秆基部连着一片球茎。<b>种下 huli</b>，种进软泥里，一个接一个。","Nine to twelve months later, the kalo stands tall. <b>Pull only the ripe kalo</b>, the big ones; the others still need time.":"九到十二个月后，kalo 长得高高的。<b>只拔成熟的 kalo</b>，也就是大的；其他的还需要时间。","Cooked, the kalo is pounded on a wooden board with a stone pounder, a little water added, into <b>poi</b>. <b>Pound</b> with a steady rhythm.":"kalo 煮熟后，放在木板上用石杵捣，加一点水，捣成 <b>poi</b>。<b>捣吧</b>，保持稳定的节奏。","Steady: let the stone do the work.":"稳住：让石杵来出力。","Smooth, purple-grey poi.":"顺滑的紫灰色 poi。","In Hawaiian tradition, who is Hāloa?":"在夏威夷传统中，Hāloa 是谁？","The first kalo, the elder brother of the Hawaiian people":"第一株 kalo，夏威夷人民的兄长","Yes: caring for kalo is caring for family.":"对：照料 kalo 就是照料家人。","A volcano goddess":"一位火山女神","That is Pele.":"那是 Pele。","No: Hāloa is the kalo.":"不对：Hāloa 就是 kalo。","At Keʻanae you let the stream water into the loʻi, planted the huli in the mud, pulled only the ripe kalo and pounded it into poi.":"在 Keʻanae，你把溪水引进 loʻi，把 huli 种进泥里，只拔成熟的 kalo，并把它捣成了 poi。","Maui’s north shore, a winter morning. A few hundred metres below the cliffs, <b>Peʻahi</b>, the wave the surfers have called <b>Jaws</b> since {#1}, is breaking: faces of {#2} to {#3} m and more when a winter swell arrives. Where do you watch it from?":"冬日清晨，Maui 北岸。悬崖下方几百米处，<b>Peʻahi</b>——冲浪者自 {#1} 年起称为 <b>Jaws</b> 的大浪——正在破碎：冬季涌浪到来时，浪面高达 {#2} 到 {#3} m，甚至更高。你要从哪里观看？","Paddle out on a rental board for a closer look":"租一块冲浪板划出去，近距离看看","From a legal spot on the cliff top, back from the edge, without crossing the fields or blocking the gates":"在崖顶的合法位置观看，远离崖边，不穿越田地，也不挡住大门","Yes. Neighbours here have seen roads blocked and fields crossed: park legally and stay back from the edge. Only expert big-wave surfers, with water safety on jet skis, go out.":"没错。这里的居民见过道路被堵、田地被人穿越：请合法停车，远离崖边。只有专业的大浪冲浪者，在摩托艇水上救援的保护下，才会下水。","Never: even experienced surfers get hurt here. Peʻahi is for experts with a rescue team.":"绝对不行：即使有经验的冲浪者在这里也会受伤。Peʻahi 只属于有救援队陪同的高手。","Missed this one: let go as it stands up, just before the lip throws.":"这次错过了：在浪竖起时、浪唇翻卷之前松手。","Waves come in <b>sets</b>. The swell rises far out, stands up into a wall of water, and the <b>lip</b> throws forward and peels along the reef. Watch one wave, then tap <b>Ready</b>.":"浪是一组一组来的，称为<b>浪组</b>。涌浪在远处升起，竖成一堵水墙，<b>浪唇</b>向前翻卷，沿着礁石一路崩开。先看一道浪，然后点击<b>准备好了</b>。","In the early {#1}s Laird Hamilton, Dave Kalama, Darrick Doerner and Buzzy Kerbox invented <b>tow-in</b> here: first with inflatable boats, then jet skis, a partner pulls the surfer on a rope onto waves too fast to paddle into, on a short board with foot straps. You drive. <b>Let go!</b> when the wave stands up, just before it breaks: two good tows.":"{#1} 年代初，Laird Hamilton、Dave Kalama、Darrick Doerner 和 Buzzy Kerbox 在这里发明了<b>拖曳冲浪</b>：先用充气艇，后来用摩托艇，由搭档用绳子把冲浪者拖进快得无法划水追上的浪里，冲浪者踩着带脚套的短板。由你来驾驶。在浪竖起、即将破碎之前点击<b>松手！</b>：完成两次漂亮的拖曳。","Let go!":"松手！","Too early: it is still a swell, he would be left behind.":"太早了：这还只是涌浪，他会被落在后面。","Too late: the lip is already throwing.":"太晚了：浪唇已经在翻卷了。","He’s in! The surfer drops down the face and races ahead of the whitewater. {A} / 2":"他进去了！冲浪者沿浪面滑下，冲在白浪前面。{A} / 2","In again! Second ride. {#1} / {#2}":"又进去了！第二次乘浪。{#1} / {#2}","On the next wave the surfer falls. His inflatable vest brings him up in the whitewater, as most big-wave surfers wear one. You are the <b>water safety</b>: pick him up on the rescue sled before the next wave arrives.":"下一道浪上，冲浪者摔倒了。充气背心把他托出白浪，大多数大浪冲浪者都穿着它。你是<b>水上救援</b>：在下一道浪到来前，用救援拖板把他接上来。","Go! Rescue":"出发！救援","Got him: on the sled, and out to the channel before the next wave.":"接到了：他上了拖板，在下一道浪到来前驶向水道。","Why do the waves of Peʻahi grow so big?":"Peʻahi 的浪为什么这么大？","Swell from deep water hits an underwater reef ridge and stands up tall":"来自深海的涌浪撞上水下的礁脊，高高竖起","Yes: the swell arrives from the deep ocean with all its power, and the ridge makes it stand up.":"没错：涌浪带着全部力量从深海而来，礁脊让它高高竖起。","The jet skis push them":"是摩托艇推起来的","No: the jet skis only tow the surfers.":"不对：摩托艇只负责拖冲浪者。","The wind blows them up near the shore":"是近岸的风把它吹大的","The power comes from winter storms far away in the North Pacific.":"浪的力量来自远在北太平洋的冬季风暴。","From the cliff above Peʻahi you watched a winter set, towed a surfer into two giant waves with the jet ski, and picked him up on the rescue sled before the next wave.":"你在 Peʻahi 上方的悬崖观看了一组冬季大浪，用摩托艇把冲浪者拖进两道巨浪，并在下一道浪到来前用救援拖板把他接了上来。","Cattle of the ranch on the track!":"牧场的牛跑到小路上了！","The guide raises a hand: stop!":"向导举起手：停！","Riders on horseback cross ahead.":"骑马的人从前面穿过。","Windward Oʻahu: behind <b>Kualoa</b>, the green walls of the Koʻolau close the valley of <b>Kaʻaʻawa</b>. The ranch takes visitors along its tracks in side-by-side UTVs. Who drives?":"Oʻahu 的迎风面：在 <b>Kualoa</b> 后方，Koʻolau 山脉的绿色峭壁合围着 <b>Kaʻaʻawa</b> 山谷。牧场用并排座 UTV 载游客沿小路游览。谁来开车？","The manu! How hard can it be?":"manu！能有多难？","An adult of {#1} or more with a driving licence; the manu rides beside":"年满 {#1} 岁、持有驾照的成年人；manu 坐在旁边","Yes. Riders come from {#1} years old, with an adult.":"没错。乘客从 {#1} 岁起即可乘坐，需有成年人陪同。","No licence for birds: the driver must be {#1} or older.":"鸟可没有驾照：驾驶员必须年满 {#1} 岁。","Before leaving, the safety briefing. What do you wear on your feet?":"出发前先听安全讲解。你脚上穿什么？","Flip-flops":"人字拖","Closed shoes":"包头鞋","Closed shoes: the tracks are dusty, muddy after rain, and full of stones.":"包头鞋：小路尘土飞扬，雨后泥泞，到处是石头。","Not on a ranch track: closed shoes only.":"牧场小路上可不行：只能穿包头鞋。","Off along the valley floor! Follow the track. When something blocks the way, <b>brake</b> in time: not too early, not too late.":"沿着谷底出发！顺着小路走。有东西挡路时，要及时<b>刹车</b>：不要太早，也不要太晚。","Too fast! Back up, and brake earlier next time.":"太快了！倒回去，下次早点刹车。","Nothing ahead yet: keep a steady speed.":"前面还没有东西：保持匀速。","Stopped. The cattle amble off the track.":"停住了。牛慢悠悠地离开了小路。","Stopped behind the guide. A gate to close, then on we go.":"停在了向导后面。关上一道门，然后继续前进。","Stopped. The riders cross, and wave.":"停住了。骑马的人穿过去，还向你挥手。","At the end of the ride, the shore. A legend says the goddess <b>Hiʻiakaikapoliopele</b> fought a <b>moʻo</b>, a giant lizard, here, and threw its tail into the sea. <b>Tap the lizard’s tail.</b>":"旅程的终点是海岸。传说女神 <b>Hiʻiakaikapoliopele</b> 在这里与一只 <b>moʻo</b>（巨蜥）搏斗，把它的尾巴扔进了海里。<b>点击蜥蜴的尾巴。</b>",", “little lizard”: the tail of the moʻo. And the long ridge behind is":"，意思是“小蜥蜴”：moʻo 的尾巴。后面那道长长的山脊叫",", “long back”.":"，意思是“长长的背”。","What was Kualoa in old Hawaiʻi?":"在古代 Hawaiʻi，Kualoa 是什么地方？","A sacred place: royal residence, school of young chiefs, said to be a place of refuge":"圣地：王室居所、年轻酋长的学校，据说还是避难所","Yes: one of the most sacred places of Oʻahu.":"没错：它是 Oʻahu 最神圣的地方之一。","A sugar mill":"一座糖厂","No: a sacred land long before the ranch.":"不对：早在牧场出现之前，这里就是圣地。","An airport":"一座机场","You rode the valley of Kaʻaʻawa beside an adult driver, in closed shoes, braked in time for the cattle, the guide and the riders, and found Mokoliʻi, the tail of the moʻo.":"你在成年驾驶员身边游览了 Kaʻaʻawa 山谷，穿着包头鞋，及时为牛群、向导和骑马的人刹车，还找到了 moʻo 的尾巴 Mokoliʻi。",", the Laysan albatross, on its nest on the grassy point: here from November to July.":"，黑背信天翁，在草地岬角上的巢里：11 月到 7 月在这里。","ʻIwa":"ʻIwa",", the great frigatebird, gliding high: here all year. In Tahiti it is the ʻōtaha.":"，白斑军舰鸟，在高空滑翔：全年都在这里。在塔希提它叫 ʻōtaha。","Koaʻe kea":"Koaʻe kea",", the white-tailed tropicbird, along the cliff: February to November. The tavaʻe of Tahiti.":"，白尾鹲，沿着悬崖飞：2 月到 11 月。就是塔希提的 tavaʻe。",", Hawaiian geese, grazing by the refuge.":"，夏威夷雁，在保护区旁吃草。","On Kauaʻi’s north shore, the lighthouse of <b>Kīlauea Point</b> stands in a seabird refuge. It opens Wednesday to Saturday, {#1} am to {#2} pm, and adults book ahead. Which day can you come?":"在 Kauaʻi 北岸，<b>Kīlauea Point</b> 的灯塔矗立在一片海鸟保护区中。保护区周三至周六开放，上午 {#1} 点到下午 {#2} 点，成人需提前预约。你哪天能来？","Open. Booked ahead, as the refuge asks.":"开放中。已按保护区要求提前预约。","Closed that day: the refuge opens Wednesday to Saturday.":"那天不开放：保护区周三至周六开放。","Take the binoculars. <b>Move them over the sky, the cliff and the point</b> (touch and drag), and hold still on a bird to name it. Four kinds to find.":"拿起望远镜。<b>在天空、悬崖和岬角上移动它</b>（按住拖动），停在一只鸟上不动就能认出它。一共要找到四种。","When do the mōlī nest at Kīlauea Point?":"mōlī 什么时候在 Kīlauea Point 筑巢？","From November to July":"11 月到 7 月","Yes: they come back each winter to the same partner and the same point.":"没错：它们每年冬天都会回到同一个伴侣身边、同一个岬角上。","Only in August":"只在 8 月","In August the young have already flown out to sea.":"到了 8 月，幼鸟已经飞向大海了。","They never land on Kauaʻi":"它们从不在 Kauaʻi 落脚","They nest on the point, in the grass.":"它们就在岬角的草丛里筑巢。","At Kīlauea Point you came on an open day, found the mōlī on its nest, the ʻiwa gliding, the koaʻe kea along the cliff and the nēnē, through the binoculars.":"你在开放日来到 Kīlauea Point，用望远镜找到了巢中的 mōlī、滑翔的 ʻiwa、沿崖飞行的 koaʻe kea，还有 nēnē。","A beach on Kauaʻi. A <b>Hawaiian monk seal</b>, ʻīlio holo i ka uaua, “the dog that runs in rough water”, is asleep on the sand. Volunteers have put up a rope and a sign. <b>Where do you stand?</b> Tap a spot.":"Kauaʻi 的一处海滩。一只<b>夏威夷僧海豹</b>——ʻīlio holo i ka uaua，意为“在汹涌海水中奔跑的狗”——正在沙滩上睡觉。志愿者拉起了绳子，立了牌子。<b>你站在哪里？</b>点击一个位置。","Yes: at least {#1} m, about {#2} feet. It is resting after hours at sea: let it sleep.":"没错：至少 {#1} m，约 {#2} 英尺。它在海里待了好几个小时，正在休息：让它睡吧。","Too close: stay at least {#1} m away, and never wake it for a photo.":"太近了：至少保持 {#1} m 的距离，绝不要为了拍照把它吵醒。","A few weeks later, a <b>mother and her pup</b>. For about a month she nurses it without eating, and she will defend it. Where do you stand now?":"几周后，来了<b>一位妈妈和她的幼崽</b>。大约一个月里，她不吃东西，一直给幼崽喂奶，而且会保护它。现在你站在哪里？","Yes: about {#1} m, {#2} feet, from a mother and pup.":"没错：离母海豹和幼崽约 {#1} m，{#2} 英尺。","Farther: a mother with her pup needs about {#1} m, {#2} feet.":"再远一点：母海豹带着幼崽时需要约 {#1} m，{#2} 英尺。","Only about {#1} monk seals are left; they live nowhere but Hawaiʻi, the only seal of the tropics. You see a seal with a fishing line caught around it. What do you do?":"僧海豹只剩下大约 {#1} 只；它们只生活在 Hawaiʻi，是热带唯一的海豹。你看到一只海豹被渔线缠住了。你会怎么做？","Pull the line off yourself":"自己把渔线扯下来","Call the NOAA seal hotline and keep watching from afar":"拨打 NOAA 海豹热线，并在远处继续观察","Yes: trained responders come. Volunteers watch the seals, but only from a distance.":"没错：受过训练的救援人员会赶来。志愿者会守护海豹，但只在远处。","Never touch a seal: it can bite, and the rescue needs experts.":"绝不要碰海豹：它会咬人，救援需要专家。","What does ʻīlio holo i ka uaua mean?":"ʻīlio holo i ka uaua 是什么意思？","The dog that runs in rough water":"在汹涌海水中奔跑的狗","Yes: the Hawaiian name of the monk seal.":"没错：这是僧海豹的夏威夷语名字。","The fish with whiskers":"长胡子的鱼","No: ʻīlio is a dog.":"不对：ʻīlio 是狗。","The sleeper of the beach":"海滩上的睡客","It sleeps a lot, but no.":"它确实很能睡，但不是这个意思。","You let a monk seal sleep on a Kauaʻi beach from {#1} m, gave a mother and pup {#2} m, and called the hotline for a seal caught in a line.":"你在 Kauaʻi 的海滩上隔着 {#1} m 让僧海豹安睡，给母海豹和幼崽留出 {#2} m，还为一只被渔线缠住的海豹拨打了热线。",", the Hawaiian stilt, on its long pink legs.":"，夏威夷长脚鹬，迈着粉红色的长腿。","ʻAlae ʻula":"ʻAlae ʻula",", the moorhen, with the red shield on its bill.":"，黑水鸡，嘴上有红色额甲。","Koloa maoli":"Koloa maoli",", the Hawaiian duck.":"，夏威夷鸭。",", grazing on the banks.":"，在岸边吃草。","From the overlook above <b>Hanalei</b>: the valley floor is a mosaic of <b>loʻi</b>, about {#1} hectares of kalo watered by the Hanalei River, in a wildlife refuge for endangered waterbirds. Can you walk down into the taro patches?":"从 <b>Hanalei</b> 上方的观景台望去：谷底是一片 <b>loʻi</b> 拼成的图案，约 {#1} 公顷的 kalo 由 Hanalei 河灌溉，位于濒危水鸟的野生动物保护区内。你能走下去进入芋田吗？","Yes, to get close to the birds":"能，为了靠近那些鸟","No: the loʻi are closed to visitors; we watch from the overlook, and no drones":"不能：loʻi 不对游客开放；我们在观景台上看，也不放无人机","Yes. The farmers and the birds share the loʻi; we look from above.":"没错。农民和鸟儿共享这些 loʻi；我们从上面看。","The wetlands and loʻi are closed to visitors.":"湿地和 loʻi 不对游客开放。","Four endangered waterbirds live here. <b>Tap each one</b> to name it.":"这里生活着四种濒危水鸟。<b>点击每一种</b>认出它。","Why is kalo good for these birds?":"为什么 kalo 对这些鸟有好处？","The flooded loʻi are wetlands where they feed and nest":"灌水的 loʻi 是湿地，它们在那里觅食和筑巢","Yes: farming kalo keeps the wetlands alive.":"没错：种植 kalo 让湿地保持生机。","The birds eat the kalo corms":"鸟吃 kalo 的球茎","They feed on small animals and plants in the water.":"它们吃水里的小动物和植物。","It is not: they avoid farms":"没有好处：它们会避开农田","Here farm and refuge are the same fields.":"在这里，农田和保护区是同一片田地。","From the Hanalei overlook you watched the loʻi without walking in, and named the āeʻo, the ʻalae ʻula, the koloa maoli and the nēnē.":"你在 Hanalei 观景台观察了 loʻi，没有走进去，并认出了 āeʻo、ʻalae ʻula、koloa maoli 和 nēnē。","Each quarter has seven houses, from the horizon up: Lā, ʻĀina, Noio, Manu, Nālani, Nāleo, Haka. A star <b>rises in {A}</b>. <b>Where will it set?</b> Tap the house.":"每个象限有七个星宫，从地平线往上依次是：Lā、ʻĀina、Noio、Manu、Nālani、Nāleo、Haka。一颗星<b>从 {A} 升起</b>。<b>它会在哪里落下？</b>点击那个星宫。","Koʻolau is the north-east, Hoʻolua the north-west, Malanai the south-east, Kona the south-west.":"Koʻolau 是东北，Hoʻolua 是西北，Malanai 是东南，Kona 是西南。","A lei poʻo, a head lei of palapalai fern":"一个 lei poʻo，用 palapalai 蕨做的头部 lei","A lei ʻāʻī, a neck lei":"一个 lei ʻāʻī，颈部 lei","Four kūpeʻe, for the wrists and the ankles":"四个 kūpeʻe，戴在手腕和脚踝上"});
